description:
Sales workflows for Notion, Gmail, Dropbox and CRM, with operator review and traceable task records.

Enable/select the plugin, then use:
@eightdegrees-sales-workflow init - Choose Chinese or English; set up operator, accounts and the Aimore workspace.
@eightdegrees-sales-workflow add-communication <content or message URL> - Prepare manual CRM Notes for review.
@eightdegrees-sales-workflow start - Enable scanning; keep the separately configured periodic task unchanged.
@eightdegrees-sales-workflow stop - Disable scanning; run-auto checks the switch and exits quietly.
@eightdegrees-sales-workflow run-auto - Discover changed/due inputs; exit idle immediately or process affected work once. Factual SMS needs no per-message review.
@eightdegrees-sales-workflow report - Update and show the daily action report; no notifications or Calendar changes.
@eightdegrees-sales-workflow reply-draft <inquiry URL> - Prepare a reply and HTML preview; stop at send approval.

Open Aimore/Today for current tasks. Submit Notion reviews/data, then wait for the shared task or run run-auto; no extra continue command. Email/CRM review stays separate from standing notification SMS permission.

Successful Gmail/AndroidSync acceptance completes dispatch. Verify our records and CRM writes; do not re-query external send status or recipient delivery.

